{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MAL","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"玛拉基书","commonName":"玛拉基书","title":"玛拉基书","order":39,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"034f7db7633ba8cb19239af3670a6054263c9d15a5531619c7a2e8c7c5e97794","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAL/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAL/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":55},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华的日子临近"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["万军之耶和华说：「那日临近，势如烧着的火炉，凡狂傲的和行恶的必如碎秸，在那日必被烧尽，根本枝条一无存留。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["但向你们敬畏我名的人必有公义的日头出现，其光线",{"noteId":4},"有医治之能。你们必出来跳跃如圈里的肥犊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["你们必践踏恶人；在我所定的日子，他们必如灰尘在你们脚掌之下。这是万军之耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["「你们当记念我仆人摩西的律法，就是我在何烈山为以色列众人所吩咐他的律例典章。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["「看哪，耶和华大而可畏之日未到以前，我必差遣先知以利亚到你们那里去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他必使父亲的心转向儿女，儿女的心转向父亲，免得我来咒诅遍地。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"-","text":"原文是翅膀","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAL/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAT/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAL/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}